            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy Capps Lepp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe! I used fresh tomatoes plus a can of tomatoes with chiles for a little zip! I served over a bed of aldente thin spaghetti this time but this would be great on homemade pizza crust or french bread as a Bruschetta! Just add some cheese! You must love anchovies for this one, scale down the anchovies if you have any doubt!"
          },
